 "title": "Charles Mix County, South Dakota -",
 "text": "Charles Mix County, South Dakota -\nOctober 18, 2026\nCharles Mix County, South Dakota\nHome\nAgenda/Minutes »\n2026\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\nHistorical Minutes\nClosed\nDirectory »\nAuditor/Elections\nClerk of Courts\nCommission\nCommunity Health Nurse & WIC Program\nCourthouse Officials\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\nExtension and 4-H\nGIS\nHighway Department\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nWelfare Office\nWeed & Pest\nEmployment\nForms\nNotices »\nPublic Notices\nCounty Ordinances\nTownships\nCharles Mix County is located in south central South Dakota along the Missouri River. The county is nearly 100 miles in length. Municipalities within the county include: Academy, Dante, Geddes, Lake Andes, Marty, Pickstown, Platte, Ravinia, and Wagner. The Charles Mix County Courthouse is located in Lake Andes, SD. The first county courthouse was located in Wheeler in 1881. In the 1950`s when the Fort Randall reservoir was built, Wheeler was flooded. The current building was designed by architect William L. Steele and is a four story building. The courthouse was built in 1917 at a cost of $150,000. In 2017, a 100 year celebration took place.\n(605) 487-6000\nCourthouse Hours\nMonday-Friday 8:00am-4:30pm\nCheck out the Charles Mix County Land Information Database\nFor the most up to date property valuation and tax status, contact the County.\nCharles Mix County\n400 Main Street\nPO Box 70\nLake Andes, SD 57356\n605-487-6000\nNews\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
